  "fullDescription": "Watercolor flower set with girl. Floral illustrations, young girl, camera, hat, boots hand painting.\n\nBright watercolor flowers clipart for wedding invitation, greeting card, thank you card, party invitation, planner sticker, design blog, website, logo, banner, poster, birthday project, flyer, brochure, cover, presentation, print template, scrapbooking artwork, baby shower and so on.\n\nThis set includes 77 items:\n– 31 individual elements in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 2500 px x 3000/4000 px / 8,3 in x 10/13,3 in);\n– 12 compositions in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 3500 px x 4000 px / 11,7 in x 13,3 in);\n– 5 backgrounds for greeting cards in JPEG files with white background (size letter 2400 px x 3300 px / 8 in x 11 in);\n– 5 backgrounds for greeting cards in PNG files with transparent background (size letter 2400 px x 3300 px / 8 in x 11 in);\n– 9 seamless (repeating) patterns in PNG files with transparent background and 9 seamless patterns in JPEG files with white and colored background (different sizes 6000 px x 6000 px / 20 in x 20 in and 5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\n– 2 wreaths in PNG files with transparent background (size 5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\nrepeating border in PNG files with transparent background (size 5000 px x 3000 px /16,7 in x 10 in);\n– 3 splashes in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 4000 px / 10 in x 13,3 in).\nCompatible with all major programs (Photoshop, Word, Canva, GIMP, etc.).\nFeel free to send me a message or leave a comment if you have any questions or concerns.\nThank you for visiting my shop!",
